[{"id":"CN-NET-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["封装","解封装"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>网络通信中的封装和解封装分别发生了什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>发送端各层把自己的控制信息加到载荷外，接收端各层读取并消费对应字段，再把载荷交给上层。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>中间交换机通常只读取链路层帧和 VLAN 上下文，路由器会重建下一跳链路帧；HTTP 内容不会在每一跳都被所有设备解析。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql-roadmap-prerequisites","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"MySQL","tags":["入门路线","学习顺序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/2ec898f2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/2ec898f2/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>可以直接从 MySQL 综合实战开始吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不建议。综合实战依赖窗口函数、执行计划、MVCC、锁和恢复坐标等前置知识。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>缺少前置概念时容易只记 SQL 形状，无法解释执行结果、并发行为与失败边界。应先按主题文章完成机制和验证练习。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-wait-strategy","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["等待","稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>提交后状态会异步变成“完成”，哪种等待方式最合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Web-first 断言直接等待业务可观察结果，并在条件提前成立时立即结束。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>固定等待五秒\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>等待全站网络空闲\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用 \u003ccode>expect(status).to_have_text(&quot;完成&quot;)\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]}]